,"section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":556,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-4ac2f131b83cb66d08f5","start":0,"end":167},{"id":"xunyu-e-o032a-q","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-d8deea5750fd311b5afa","layer":"original","quote":"恽早卒。子甝、霬，﹝一﹞以外甥故犹宠待。","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":172,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":20},{"id":"xunyu-e-o033a-q","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-e5d893f8261a404cb8f0","layer":"original","quote":"恽子甝，嗣为散骑常侍〖6〗，进爵广阳乡侯。年三十薨。子頵嗣。","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":173,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":30},{"id":"xunyu-q-o032","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-d8deea5750fd311b5afa","layer":"original","quote":"恽早卒。子甝、霬，﹝一﹞以外甥故犹宠待。恽弟俣，御史中丞〖4〗；俣弟诜，大将军从事中郎：皆知名，早卒。﹝二﹞诜弟顗，咸熙中为司空〖5〗。﹝三﹞","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":172,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":71},{"id":"xunyu-q-o033","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-e5d893f8261a404cb8f0","layer":"original","quote":"恽子甝，嗣为散骑常侍〖6〗，进爵广阳乡侯。年三十薨。子頵嗣。﹝四﹞霬官至中领军。薨，谥曰贞侯，追赠骠骑将军。子恺嗣。霬妻，司马景王、文王之妹也；二王皆与亲善。咸熙中，开建五等〖7〗。以霬著勋前朝，改封恺南顿子。﹝五﹞","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":173,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":108}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
